"claim": "{\"channel\": \"Phone call transcript\", \"claim_id\": \"POL-1234567890\", \"incident_date\": \"2025-09-21\", \"report_date\": \"2025-09-21\", \"reported_by\": \"Mark Evans\", \"incident_type\": \"slip_and_fall\", \"location_type\": \"bakery\", \"police_report_number\": \"\", \"incident_description\": \"Someone fell at the bakery on Saturday the 20th, at 1220 Main Street\", \"InsuredObject\": {\",\"estimated_value\": \"\", \"location_address\": \"\", \"make_model\": \"\", \"object_id\": \"\", \"object_type\": \"\", \"year\": \"\", \"required\": [], \"title\": \"InsuredObject\"}, \"PolicyDetails\": {\",\"coverage_type\": \"\", \"effective_date\": \"\", \"expiration_date\": \"\", \"policy_number\": \"\", \"policyholder_name\": \"\", \"required\": [], \"title\": \"PolicyDetails\"}, \"properties\": {\",\"header\": {\",\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ClaimHeader\", \"description\": \"Basic claim information\"}, \"incident_description\": {\",\"anyOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/IncidentDescription\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"description\": \"Structured incident details\"}, \"insured_objects\": {\",\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\",\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/InsuredObject\"}}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"description\": \"List of insured objects involved, if applicable\"}, \"policy_details\": {\",\"anyOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/PolicyDetails\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"description\": \"Policy information if available\"}}, \"required\": [], \"title\": \"InsuranceClaim\"}", "\"required\": [], \"title\": \"InsuranceClaim\"}":["claim_text","Phone call transcript","2025-09-21","Can I have your policy number, please?","Caller: 'I don’t have it handy—I think it was something like POL- or PLO-... I’ll have to dig up the folder. The papers are in my desk at work. Sorry.'","Rep: 'That’s fine, we can still log the claim.'","Caller: 'So, I’m reporting that someone fell at my shop yesterday, Saturday the 20th. It’s at 1220 Main Street, the bakery I run. They slipped by the counter. I didn’t catch their name, but an ambulance came. I didn’t get a police report number—was I supposed to ask for that?','Rep: 'That’s okay, we can follow up.","Caller: 'I don’t even know what the damage figure is supposed to be. My assistant says it could be a lawsuit, but I’m just trying to cover my bases.'","Assistant: 'Until I have a policy number, we can't log the claim fully. If I can have your name, I can fill out the rest of the details for the claim after you've found the policy number.'","Caller: 'I'll get it to you as soon as I can. The name is Mark Evans.'"]

}"]

